---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {articles,sections,url} from '../lib/content';
const nodes=sections.flatMap((section,col)=>articles.filter(a=>a.section===section).map((a,row)=>({...a,x:20+col*190,y:85+row*113})));
const edges=nodes.flatMap(a=>a.related.map((s:string)=>({from:a.slug,to:s}))).filter((e,i,all)=>all.findIndex(x=>[x.from,x.to].sort().join(':')===[e.from,e.to].sort().join(':'))===i);
const shortNames=['Scope','Three machines','Boot handoff','Device tree','CPU compatibility','Memory & caches','Time & interrupts','Service discovery','Storage ABI','Async completion','HFS integrity','Graphics stack','Surface memory','Presentation','Display blanking','HID readiness','Buttons','Touch','Audio','Power','Emulator fidelity','Observability','Source archaeology','Preservation'];
const labels=(t:string)=>{const out:string[]=[];let line='';for(const word of t.split(' ')){if((line+' '+word).length>22){out.push(line);line=word;}else line+=(line?' ':'')+word;}out.push(line);return out.slice(0,3)};
---
<Base title="Concept map" description="Explore the relationships between boot, memory, storage, graphics, interaction and the research method." wide><div class="page-heading map-heading"><div><span class="section-number">A MAP FOR UNDERSTANDING</span><h1>Everything has<br/>a neighbor.</h1></div><p>Follow a contract across the system. Select a chapter to see its connections and evidence. Lines denote editorial relationships, not a recovered call graph.</p></div><div class="map-toolbar"><label for="concept-select">Find a concept<select id="concept-select"><option value="">All concepts</option>{articles.map(a=><option value={a.slug}>{a.title}</option>)}</select></label><div role="group" aria-label="Map display"><button id="graph-view" aria-pressed="true">Graph</button><button id="map-view" aria-pressed="false">Structured</button><button id="list-view" aria-pressed="false">List view</button><button id="map-reset">Reset</button></div><span class="mono">24 CONCEPTS · 6 DOMAINS</span></div><div class="map-layout"><div><div class="floating-graph" id="floating-graph"><div class="graph-controls"><span id="graph-help">Drag a node or pan the canvas. Select to read.</span><div role="group" aria-label="Graph zoom"><button id="graph-out" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button id="graph-fit">Fit</button><button id="graph-in" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button></div></div><svg id="force-graph" viewBox="0 0 1000 780" aria-label="Connected research concepts" aria-describedby="graph-help"><g id="graph-camera"><g class="force-edges">{edges.map(e=><line data-edge-from={e.from} data-edge-to={e.to}/>)}</g>{articles.map(a=><a href={url('articles/'+a.slug+'/')} data-node={a.slug} data-force-node={a.slug} data-domain={a.section} aria-label={`Inspect ${a.title}`}><circle class="hit-target" r="30"/><circle r="7"/><text text-anchor="middle" y="26">{labels(shortNames[a.order-1]).map((line,j)=><tspan x="0" dy={j===0?0:15}>{line}</tspan>)}</text></a>)}</g></svg><div class="graph-domains" aria-label="Domains">{sections.map(s=><span data-domain={s}><i aria-hidden="true"/>{s}</span>)}</div><p class="graph-foot">24 concepts · lines connect related readings · use Find a concept or List view for keyboard exploration</p></div><div class="map-canvas" id="map-canvas" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 1160 720" class="concept-svg" aria-label="Research concept map"><defs><pattern id="mapgrid" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="1" cy="1" r=".65" fill="#bbc3cc"/></pattern></defs><rect width="1160" height="720" fill="url(#mapgrid)"/>{sections.map((s,i)=><g><text class="graph-domain" x={20+i*190} y="36">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / {s}</text><path d={`M${20+i*190} 49h166`} stroke="#bdc7d2"/></g>)}<g class="graph-edges">{edges.map(e=>{const a=nodes.find(n=>n.slug===e.from),b=nodes.find(n=>n.slug===e.to);return <path data-edge-from={e.from} data-edge-to={e.to} d={`M${a.x+83} ${a.y+36} C${a.x+83} ${a.y+95} ${b.x+83} ${b.y-30} ${b.x+83} ${b.y+36}`}/>})}</g>{nodes.map(a=><a href={url('articles/'+a.slug+'/')} data-node={a.slug} aria-label={`Inspect ${a.title}`}><g class="graph-node" transform={`translate(${a.x},${a.y})`}><rect width="166" height="82" rx="3"/><text class="graph-no" x="12" y="19">{String(a.order).padStart(2,'0')}</text>{labels(a.title).map((line,j)=><text class="graph-label" x="12" y={37+j*15}>{line}</text>)}<circle cx="151" cy="17" r="2.5"/></g></a>)}</svg></div><div class="map-list" id="map-list" hidden>{sections.map(s=><section><h2>{s}</h2>{articles.filter(a=>a.section===s).map(a=><a href={url('articles/'+a.slug+'/')}><strong>{a.title}</strong><span>{a.description}</span></a>)}</section>)}</div></div><aside class="map-detail" id="map-detail" aria-live="polite"><span class="section-number">HOW TO EXPLORE</span><h2>A system of contracts.</h2><p>Start with a concept. Its direct connections stay visible; the rest recede.</p><p>Read each connection as a suggested line of inquiry. The article explains the relationship and its limits.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('tours/boot/')}>Prefer a guided path? →</a><div class="map-key"><span><i class="line"/> Selected concept</span><span><i class="line dashed"/> Connected reading</span></div></aside></div><noscript><style is:inline>#floating-graph{display:none!important}#map-list{display:block!important}</style><p>The interactive selection needs JavaScript. Every node is also a direct chapter link, and the complete <a href={url('library/')}>chapter index</a> is available.</p></noscript><script type="application/json" id="map-data" set:html={JSON.stringify(articles.map(({Content,headings,raw,...a})=>a)).replace(/</g,'\u003c')}/><script src="../lib/map.ts"/><script src="../lib/force-graph.ts"/></Base>
